<title>CANADA: Saskatchewan Agriculture details seeding progress.</title>
<headline>Saskatchewan Agriculture details seeding progress.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saskatchewan Agriculture on Tuesday detailed the level of seeding progress to Sunday.</p>
<p>	   S.WHEAT DURUM OATS BARLEY FLAX CANOLA ALL CROPS (PCT)</p>
